  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8504.01 Processing Request",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8504.01 Processing Request.\n\n(a) A request shall be granted and a blue envelope as set forth in Saf-C 8505.01 will be provided to the requestor if the director determines that the requirements set forth in Saf-C 8503.01(b)-(e) have been satisfied.\n\n(b) A request shall be denied if the director determines that any of the requirements set forth in Saf-C 8503.01(b)-(e) are not met. If a request is denied, the director shall state in writing the reason(s) for the denial and return Form DMSV 653 “Blue Envelope Request Form” (rev 07/26) to the requestor.\n\n(c) An individual whose request is denied may submit a written request to the director setting forth a detailed explanation as to the reasons the submitted DMSV 653 “Blue Envelope Request Form” (rev 07/26) should be issued. The director’s decision shall be based on the criteria in (b) above and shall be final.\n\nSource. #14643, INTERIM, eff 7-3-26, EXPIRES: 12-30-26",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c8500.html"
